<title>THAILAND: Laem Thong Q3 net profit up.</title>
<headline>Laem Thong Q3 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the three months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		   0.33    vs     0.37</p>
<p>    Net			   53.34    vs    37.3</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Laem Thong Bank Plc, a Thai commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
